he fund's actual portfolio snapshot.\n- **The PCF (Portfolio Composition File)** is the basket used for creations and redemptions. It can differ from holdings due to cash components, representative sampling, or substitutions. It's distributed mainly via NSCC to authorized participants.\n\n**Requesting the PCF:** Check the sponsor's website first, since Rule 6c-11 generally requires daily public posting, but don't assume it's there. If it isn't, contact the sponsor's investor relations, or ask your broker or a market-data provider. Specify the \"PCF\" or \"creation basket\" for the current business day.","ttft_ms":2281,"type":"result","duration_ms":3225,"uuid":"53476fdb-02ed-450b-861e-68fc6fe1d072","ttft_stream_ms":429,"time_to_request_ms":70,"first_content_frame_ms":429,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
